      {
        "id": "textbook-search-setting",
        "moduleId": "search-problem",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "搜索问题：最大化整条序列的条件概率",
        "markdown": "在序列生成中，解码器在时间步 $t'$ 输出词元 $y_{t'}$ 的条件概率，取决于此前的输出子序列 $y_1, \\dots, y_{t'-1}$ 和由输入序列编码得到的上下文变量 $\\mathbf{c}$。设输出词表为 $\\mathcal{Y}$，其中包含结束词元“<eos>”，最大词元数为 $T'$，那么最优序列就是使下式最大的输出序列：\n\n$$\n\\prod_{t'=1}^{T'} P(y_{t'} \\mid y_1, \\dots, y_{t'-1}, \\mathbf{c})\n$$\n\n所有可能的候选序列共有 $\\mathcal{O}(|\\mathcal{Y}|^{T'})$ 个；实际输出会丢弃“<eos>”之后的部分。搜索策略要解决的正是如何在这个指数级空间中高效地找到好序列。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-567d03760c49273830ecff85",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000074"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "现代循环神经网络",
                "束搜索"
              ],
              "lineStart": 15849,
              "lineEnd": 15966,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0004/images/75499ea676c8ac4239933cf190db1bd94237bf51c552a6d76be49d7528a32d41.jpg",
                "parts/part-0004/images/cfc6dd97551d93bca5012425850fd22af082be76e1f92170ec97f2b5c3c5ca22.jpg",
                "parts/part-0004/images/2d3c8a43b7c1724ab550c42c369564f5c7b816a9dd467e173cc2f8d57019124b.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "5ae00a1d55577f6101e6364145d8bda6f302a7111df3fb5ab7e6ad095484260f"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-local-vs-global",
        "moduleId": "search-problem",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "补充：逐步最优不等于整体最优",
        "markdown": "贪心搜索在每一步只保留一个前缀，因此它优化的是“在当前前缀下选哪个词元”，而不是“整条序列的条件概率”。当前步的最大条件概率只说明这个局部选择好，并不保证把它接在后面能得到全局最好的序列。一旦某个较早的词元被选定，后续所有条件概率都建立在这个前缀之上，模型无法回到被放弃的分支。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-search-setting"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-greedy",
        "moduleId": "greedy-and-exhaustive",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "贪心搜索：每步取条件概率最高的词元",
        "markdown": "贪心搜索在每个时间步 $t'$ 都从词表 $\\mathcal{Y}$ 中选出条件概率最高的词元：\n\n$$\ny_{t'} = \\underset{y \\in \\mathcal{Y}}{\\operatorname{argmax}} P(y \\mid y_1, \\dots, y_{t'-1}, \\mathbf{c})\n$$\n\n一旦序列中出现“<eos>”或达到最大长度 $T'$，解码就结束。它每一步只评估 $|\\mathcal{Y}|$ 个词元，因此总计算量为 $\\mathcal{O}(|\\mathcal{Y}|T')$。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-567d03760c49273830ecff85",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000074"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "现代循环神经网络",
                "束搜索"
              ],
              "lineStart": 15849,
              "lineEnd": 15966,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0004/images/75499ea676c8ac4239933cf190db1bd94237bf51c552a6d76be49d7528a32d41.jpg",
                "parts/part-0004/images/cfc6dd97551d93bca5012425850fd22af082be76e1f92170ec97f2b5c3c5ca22.jpg",
                "parts/part-0004/images/2d3c8a43b7c1724ab550c42c369564f5c7b816a9dd467e173cc2f8d57019124b.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "5ae00a1d55577f6101e6364145d8bda6f302a7111df3fb5ab7e6ad095484260f"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-greedy-counterexample",
        "moduleId": "greedy-and-exhaustive",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "教材反例：第二高的词元带来更高总概率",
        "markdown": "教材用两个对照例子说明贪心搜索不保证最优。图 9.8.1 中每步都取条件概率最高的词元，得到序列“A”“B”“C”“<eos>”，其条件概率为 $0.5 \\times 0.4 \\times 0.4 \\times 0.6 = 0.048$。图 9.8.2 在第 2 步改选第二高的词元“C”，此后前缀从“A”“B”变为“A”“C”，第 3、4 步的条件概率也随之改变；最终序列“A”“C”“B”“<eos>”的概率为 $0.5 \\times 0.3 \\times 0.6 \\times 0.6 = 0.054$，反而更大。",
        "provenance": {
