      {
        "id": "model-trace-reading",
        "moduleId": "beam-mechanism",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "补充：从例子读出三个要点",
        "markdown": "这个例子说明束搜索的三个要点。第一，候选不只来自最后一个时间步，之前保留的较短前缀（如 A、C、AB、CE）同样可能成为最终输出，因为序列可能在更早的位置结束。第二，剪枝发生在每个时间步：每一层只保留分数最高的 $k$ 个前缀，其余 $k|\\mathcal{Y}|-k$ 个分支被丢弃。第三，束宽 $k$ 控制保留的广度：$k=1$ 时退化为贪心搜索，$k$ 增大时覆盖更多前缀，但每步计算量也随之线性增加。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-beam-definition",
            "textbook-beam-trace"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-beam-expansion",
        "moduleId": "beam-mechanism",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "逐步累计前缀的条件概率",
        "markdown": "候选序列的分数由各步条件概率累乘得到。例如对两个保留前缀分别扩展时：\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{l}\nP(A, y_2 \\mid \\mathbf{c}) = P(A \\mid \\mathbf{c})P(y_2 \\mid A, \\mathbf{c}), \\\\\nP(C, y_2 \\mid \\mathbf{c}) = P(C \\mid \\mathbf{c})P(y_2 \\mid C, \\mathbf{c}),\n\\end{array}\n$$\n\n到时间步 3 继续用同样方式累计：\n\n$$\n\\begin{array}{l}\nP(A, B, y_3 \\mid \\mathbf{c}) = P(A, B \\mid \\mathbf{c})P(y_3 \\mid A, B, \\mathbf{c}), \\\\\nP(C, E, y_3 \\mid \\mathbf{c}) = P(C, E \\mid \\mathbf{c})P(y_3 \\mid C, E, \\mathbf{c}).\n\\end{array}\n$$",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
