      {
        "id": "textbook-final-scoring",
        "moduleId": "scoring-and-selection",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "最终选择：长度惩罚后的对数概率",
        "markdown": "由于候选序列长度不同，教材用长度惩罚后的对数概率作为最终选择标准：\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{L^{\\alpha}} \\log P(y_1, \\dots, y_L \\mid \\mathbf{c}) = \\frac{1}{L^{\\alpha}} \\sum_{t'=1}^{L} \\log P(y_{t'} \\mid y_1, \\dots, y_{t'-1}, \\mathbf{c}),\n$$\n\n其中 $L$ 是候选序列长度，$\\alpha$ 通常取 0.75。较长的序列在对数求和中有更多项，分母 $L^{\\alpha}$ 用来惩罚长序列。束搜索的总计算量为 $\\mathcal{O}(k|\\mathcal{Y}|T')$，介于贪心搜索和穷举搜索之间。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-567d03760c49273830ecff85",
